From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 03:52:55 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] advpack: reboot checks, registry and file backups, rollback
 of per-user stubs

NeedRebootInit/NeedReboot compare the pending file operations; RebootCheckOnInstall
reports S_OK when a file the section copies, renames or deletes is held open;
RegSaveRestore, RegRestoreAll and RegSaveRestoreOnINF keep and restore registry
values in a backup key; FileSaveRestore and FileSaveRestoreOnINF keep and restore
files in a backup directory (Base.ini lists them, Base.dat holds the copies);
SetPerUserSecValues with bRollback keeps the previous values and runs the stub
through UserInstStubWrapper. Removes 6 todo_wine in advpack's test.

diff --git a/dlls/advpack/advpack.c b/dlls/advpack/advpack.c
